  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 13 November 2002 the proposed single storey detached garage 6.5m long, 8.1m wide, with a maximum height of 3.0m was not lawful within the meaning of section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\r\n\r\nThe proposed garage would be nearer to a highway which bounds the curtliage than any point 20 metres from the highway.  As such, the proposal does not meet the requirements of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class E of the Town and County Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 1995 and planning permission is therefore required.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n"
